{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46176","headline":"秋末寄上桐江冯使君 · 贯休","name":"秋末寄上桐江冯使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山东山色胜诸山，谢守清高不可攀。\n薄俗尽于言下泰，苦心唯到醉中闲。\n香凝锦帐抄书後，月转棠阴送客还。\n野客沾恩归未得，萧萧霜叶满柴关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}